💻 Code Editor

This is a browser-based code editor, similar to VS Code.

You can:

Write Python code
Edit project files
Debug code
Run applications

===

Enable idle shutdown

If enabled:

You stop using Code Editor
        ↓
Idle for some time
        ↓
AWS automatically shuts it down
        ↓
Helps avoid unnecessary usage/charges

For learning, idle shutdown is a useful option.

